<title>JAPAN: Japan July lead imports jump 130.7 pct year/year.</title>
<headline>Japan July lead imports jump 130.7 pct year/year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined lead imports in July totalled 2,565 tonnes, up 130.7 percent from 1,112 tonnes in the same month a year earlier, Finance Ministry data issued on Wednesday showed.</p>
<p>The breakdown is as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		   July 96	   June 96	  July 95</p>
<p> Total	    2,565	     1,739	    1,112</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> China	    1,359		 861		260</p>
<p> Peru		 267		 300		252</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in the first seven months of 1996 were 24,857 tonnes against 67,439 during the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodities Desk (813 3432 6179)</p>
</text>
